UnitPrivacyPoolRelay::constructor
├── When pool is address zero
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ZeroPool
├── When entrypoint is address zero
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ZeroEntrypoint
├── When announcer is address zero
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ZeroAnnouncer
├── When params are valid
│   ├── It should set POOL immutable
│   ├── It should set ENTRYPOINT immutable
│   └── It should set ANNOUNCER immutable
└── When root history not above max batch
    └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_RootHistoryTooSmall

UnitPrivacyPoolRelay::relay
├── When withdrawnValue is zero
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ZeroWithdrawal
├── When recipient is zero
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ZeroRecipient
├── When msg value does not match nativeGas
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_NativeGasMismatch
├── When fee exceeds maxRelayFee
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_FeeExceedsMax
├── When max relay fee is zero uncapped
│   └── It should relay the nonzero fee without reverting FeeExceedsMax
├── When fee exceeds withdrawnValue
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_FeeExceedsWithdrawal
├── When feeRecipient is address zero
│   └── It should use msg sender as fee recipient
├── When asset is native
│   ├── When ETH transfer to recipient fails
│   │   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ETHNetAmountTransferFailed
│   ├── When fee is not zero
│   │   ├── When ETH fee transfer fails
│   │   │   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_ETHFeeTransferFailed
│   │   └── When ETH fee transfer succeeds
│   │       ├── It should call pool transact
│   │       ├── It should transfer recipient amount + msg value to recipient
│   │       ├── It should transfer fee to fee recipient
│   │       └── It should emit Relayed event
│   └── When fee is zero
│       ├── It should call pool transact
│       ├── It should transfer full amount + msg value to recipient
│       ├── It should not transfer fee
│       └── It should emit Relayed event
└── When asset is ERC20
    ├── When ERC20 transfer to recipient fails
    │   ├── When returning false
    │   │   └── It should revert with SafeTransferLib TransferFailed
    │   └── When reverting
    │       └── It should revert with SafeTransferLib TransferFailed
    ├── When fee is not zero
    │   ├── When ERC20 fee transfer fails
    │   │   ├── When returning false
    │   │   │   └── It should revert with SafeTransferLib TransferFailed
    │   │   └── When reverting
    │   │       └── It should revert with SafeTransferLib TransferFailed
    │   └── When ERC20 transfers succeed
    │       ├── When msg value is zero
    │       │   ├── It should call pool transact
    │       │   ├── It should transfer recipient amount to recipient
    │       │   ├── It should transfer fee to fee recipient
    │       │   └── It should emit Relayed event
    │       └── When msg value is greater than zero
    │           ├── When ETH msg value transfer to recipient succeeds
    │           │   ├── It should call pool transact
    │           │   ├── It should transfer recipient amount to recipient
    │           │   ├── It should transfer fee to fee recipient
    │           │   ├── It should emit Relayed event
    │           │   └── It should transfer msg value to recipient
    │           └── When ETH msg value transfer to recipient fails
    │               └── It should revert with ETHTransferFailed
    └── When fee is zero
        ├── When msg value is zero
        │   ├── It should call pool transact
        │   ├── It should transfer full amount to recipient
        │   ├── It should not transfer fee
        │   └── It should emit Relayed event
        └── When msg value is greater than zero
            ├── When ETH msg value transfer to recipient succeeds
            │   ├── It should call pool transact
            │   ├── It should transfer full amount to recipient
            │   ├── It should not transfer fee
            │   ├── It should emit Relayed event
            │   └── It should transfer msg value to recipient
            └── When ETH msg value transfer to recipient fails
                └── It should revert with ETHTransferFailed

UnitPrivacyPoolRelay::registerAndRelay
├── When the keystore registration reverts
│   └── It should bubble up the revert and not relay
└── When registration succeeds
    ├── It should resolve the keystore off the pool
    ├── It should register the account before calling pool transact
    └── It should relay the withdrawal to the recipient

UnitPrivacyPoolRelay::relayAndAnnounce
├── When params are valid
│   ├── It should call pool transact
│   ├── It should call announcer announce with the announcement args
│   ├── It should emit Relayed event
│   └── It should relay the withdrawal to the stealth recipient
└── When stealth address does not match recipient
    ├── It should not call pool transact
    ├── It should not call the announcer
    └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_AnnouncementRecipientMismatch

UnitPrivacyPoolRelay::receive
├── When sender is not pool
│   └── It should revert with PrivacyPoolRelay_OnlyPoolCanSendETH
└── When sender is pool
    ├── It should accept the ETH
    └── It should increase relay balance
